      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/east-san-gabriel-21317"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Prior to 1990, the area that is now East San Gabriel belonged to the unincorporated Southwest San Gabriel Valley division.",
